<title>UK: NordLB sets $150 mln D. Telekom exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets $150 mln D. Telekom exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norddeutsche Landesbank GZ has launched a $150 million bond exchangeable into shares of Deutsche Telekom AG, joint lead managers Salomon Brothers International and Norddeutsche Landesbank said.  </p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	IND COUPON 3.9-3.25  MATURITY    11.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    11.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   IND PREMIUM 22-24 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE 2.75 YEARS AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
